GENERATED_FROM: Brainstack's own `bsb` binary (Go), the MCP connector for
usebrainstack.com. One native binary, no Node.

2026-09-11: local capture hooks were RETIRED (apps run in cloud/VM, so a local
hook shipping a transcript is unreliable). Capture is now MCP-driven filing over
the connector (private by default); deterministic auto-capture is a Compliance-API
feature. The plugin is connector-only — no hooks.json, no hook declarations.

Binary verb surface: `bsb connect <url>` (MCP stdio bridge). `bsb login` /
`bsb ingest` exist for the one-time history importer (hosted in the
brainstack-chatgpt repo, which scans Claude Code / Cowork / Codex transcripts).
OAuth token at ~/.brainstack/token.json.
